# draw1: FILE menu, its Escape, a context menu of the channel button, F7 (mixer) and F8 once, for the HLE check run.
snap wiz0
advance 4000
tap 13
advance 3000
snap e3000
move 18 19
advance 100
down L
advance 200
up L
advance 1500
snap file-menu
tap 27
advance 1000
move 522 144
advance 100
down R
advance 200
up R
advance 1500
snap ctx-menu
tap 27
advance 1000
tap 0x76
advance 3000
snap mixer
tap 0x76
advance 1000
tap 0x77
advance 3000
snap f8
tap 27
advance 2000
snap end-menus
end
